{'symbol': 'MO', 'date': '2022-06-24 12:00:00', 'title': 'PODA COMPLETES MULTIPARTY SALE OF INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY ASSETS FOR US$100.5 MILLION', 'text': 'VANCOUVER, BC , JUNE 24, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ - PODA HOLDINGS, INC. ("PODA" OR THE "COMPANY") (CSE: PODA) (\u200eFSE: 99L) (OTC: PODAF)\xa0IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE THAT, FURTHER TO ITS NEWS RELEASE DATED MAY 13, 2022, THE COMPANY, TOGETHER WITH RYAN SELBY AND RYAN KARKAIRAN (THE\xa0\u200e\u200e"OWNERS"), HAS COMPLETED THE SALE OF\xa0SUBSTANTIALLY ALL OF THE ASSETS AND PROPERTIES \u200eUSED IN THE COMPANY\'S BUSINESS (THE "PURCHASED ASSETS") TO ALTRIA CLIENT SERVICES LLC ("ALCS"), A SUBSIDIARY OF ALTRIA GROUP, INC. (NYSE:MO), FOR A TOTAL PURCHASE PRICE OF US$100.5 MILLION ("PURCHASE PRICE"), SUBJECT TO CERTAIN \u200eADJUSTMENTS AND HOLDBACKS (THE\xa0\u200e\u200e"TRANSACTION"), PURSUANT TO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT DATED MAY 13, 2022 (THE "ASSET PURCHASE AGREEMENT").'}{'symbol': 'AMZN', 'date': '2022-06-24 18:38:00', 'title': 'AMAZON.COM, INC. (NASDAQ: AMZN) SHAREHOLDER CLASS ACTION ALERT: BERNSTEIN LIEBHARD LLP REMINDS INVESTORS OF THE DEADLINE TO FILE A LEAD PLAINTIFF MOTION IN A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST AMAZON.COM, INC. (NASDAQ: AMZN)', 'text': 'DID YOU LOSE MONEY ON INVESTMENTS IN AMAZON.COM?\xa0 IF SO, PLEASE VISIT\xa0AMAZON.COM, INC. SHAREHOLDER CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT\xa0OR CONTACT\xa0 PETER ALLOCCO AT (212) 951-2030\xa0OR\xa0PALLOCCO@BERNLIEB.COM\xa0TO DISCUSS YOUR RIGHTS.'}{'symbol': 'AMZN', 'date': '2022-06-24 05:45:00', 'title': 'AMZN SHAREHOLDER ALERT: JAKUBOWITZ LAW REMINDS AMAZON SHAREHOLDERS OF A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF JULY 5, 2022', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JUNE 24, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JAKUBOWITZ LAW ANNOUNCES THAT A SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS COMMENCED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF AMAZON.COM, INC. (NASDAQ: AMZN). TO RECEIVE UPDATES ON THE LAWSUIT, FILL OUT THE FORM: HTTPS://CLAIMYOURLOSS.COM/SECURITIES/AMAZON-COM-INC-LOSS-SUBMISSION-FORM/?ID=29043&FROM=4 THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES FOR SHAREHOLDERS WHO PURCHASED AMAZON BETWEEN FEBRUARY 1, 2019 AND\xa0APRIL 5, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'ANSS', 'date': '2022-06-24 09:05:00', 'title': 'ANSYS AND TSMC COLLABORATE TO DELIVER MULTIPHYSICS DESIGN METHODOLOGY FOR WIRELESS CHIPS', 'text': "ANSYS PLATFORM SUPPORTS TSMC'S N6RF DESIGN REFERENCE FLOW TO HELP ENABLE FASTER AND HIGHER PERFORMANCE RADIO FREQUENCY CHIPS FOR 5G, WI-FI, AND IOT WITH TSMC'S N6RF PROCESS TECHNOLOGY / KEY HIGHLIGHTS THE ANSYS MULTIPHYSICS PLATFORM SUPPORTS TSMC'S N6RF DESIGN REFERENCE FLOW FOR DESIGNING RADIO FREQUENCY (RF) CHIPS WITH TSMC N6 PROCESS TECHNOLOGY ANSYS SOLUTIONS, INCLUDING ANSYS® RAPTORX™, ANSYS® EXALTO™, ANSYS® VELOCERF™, AND ANSYS® TOTEM™, ARE ENABLED THROUGHOUT THE TSMC N6RF DESIGN REFERENCE FLOW FROM IMPLEMENTATION TO VERIFICATION PITTSBURGH , JUNE 24, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- \xa0ANSYS\xa0(NASDAQ: ANSS) COLLABORATED WITH TSMC ON THE TSMC N6RF DESIGN REFERENCE FLOW FOR TSMC'S N6 PROCESS TECHNOLOGY. THE REFERENCE FLOW USES THE ANSYS MULTIPHYSICS SIMULATION PLATFORM, INCLUDING ANSYS\xa0RAPTORX, ANSYS\xa0EXALTO, ANSYS\xa0VELOCERF, AND ANSYS TOTEM TO PROVIDE A LOW-RISK AND PROVEN SOLUTION FOR DESIGNING RADIO-FREQUENCY CHIPS."}{'symbol': 'ANSS', 'date': '2022-06-24 09:00:00', 'title': "ANSYS MULTIPHYSICS SOLUTIONS ACHIEVE CERTIFICATION FOR TSMC'S N3E AND N4P PROCESS TECHNOLOGIES", 'text': "ANSYS EXTENDS COLLABORATION WITH TSMC TO DELIVER SOPHISTICATED POWER INTEGRITY AND ELECTROMIGRATION SIGNOFF SOLUTIONS FOR ADVANCED APPLICATIONS / KEY HIGHLIGHTS ANSYS® REDHAWK-SC™ AND ANSYS® TOTEM™ POWER INTEGRITY PLATFORMS ARE CERTIFIED FOR TSMC'S NEWEST N3E AND N4P PROCESS TECHNOLOGIES THE CERTIFICATION SUPPORTS CUSTOMERS TO UNLEASH THEIR INNOVATIONS WITH ANSYS REDHAWK-SC AND ANSYS TOTEM RESPECTIVELY PITTSBURGH , JUNE 24, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ANSYS\xa0(NASDAQ: ANSS) AND TSMC EXTENDED THEIR LONG-STANDING COLLABORATION TO ACHIEVE CERTIFICATION OF ANSYS' POWER INTEGRITY SOFTWARE FOR TSMC'S INDUSTRY-LEADING N4P AND N3E PROCESS TECHNOLOGIES. THE CERTIFICATION FOR ANSYS REDHAWK-SC AND TOTEM ENABLES NEXT GENERATION SILICON DESIGNS FOR MACHINE LEARNING, 5G MOBILE, AND HIGH-PERFORMANCE COMPUTING (HPC) APPLICATIONS."}{'symbol': 'AJG', 'date': '2022-06-24 05:30:00', 'title': 'ARTHUR J. GALLAGHER & CO. ACQUIRES INNOVU GROUP HOLDING COMPANY LIMITED', 'text': 'ROLLING MEADOWS, ILL. , JUNE 24, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ARTHUR J.'}{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2022-06-24 17:14:00', 'title': 'BLACKROCK® CANADA ANNOUNCES FINAL JUNE CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR THE ISHARES® PREMIUM MONEY MARKET ETF', 'text': 'TORONTO, JUNE 24, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BLACKROCK ASSET MANAGEMENT CANADA LIMITED (“BLACKROCK CANADA”), AN INDIRECT, WHOLLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF BLACKROCK, INC. (NYSE: BLK), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE FINAL JUNE 2022 CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR THE ISHARES PREMIUM MONEY MARKET ETF. UNITHOLDERS OF RECORD ON JUNE 27, 2022 WILL RECEIVE CASH DISTRIBUTIONS PAYABLE ON JUNE 30, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2022-06-24 08:30:00', 'title': 'RBC BEARINGS RECEIVES BOEING 2022 SUPPLIER OF THE YEAR AWARD', 'text': "OXFORD, CONN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--RBC BEARINGS INCORPORATED (NASDAQ: ROLL, ROLLP), A LEADING INTERNATIONAL MANUFACTURER OF HIGHLY ENGINEERED PRECISION BEARINGS, COMPONENTS AND ESSENTIAL SYSTEMS FOR THE INDUSTRIAL, DEFENSE AND AEROSPACE INDUSTRIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS RECEIVED RECOGNITION FROM THE BOEING COMPANY (NYSE: BA) AS ONE OF ITS TOP SUPPLIERS AT THE COMPANY'S 2022 SUPPLIER OF THE YEAR EVENT IN LOS ANGELES. “THE ENTIRE RBC BEARINGS ORGANIZATION IS VERY PROUD OF THE SUPPLIER OF THE YEAR A"}{'symbol': 'BMY', 'date': '2022-06-24 19:05:00', 'title': "U.S. FDA APPROVES BRISTOL MYERS SQUIBB'S CAR T CELL THERAPY BREYANZI® FOR RELAPSED OR REFRACTORY LARGE B-CELL LYMPHOMA AFTER ONE PRIOR THERAPY", 'text': "PRINCETON, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $BMY #BREYANZI--U.S. FDA APPROVES BMS'S CAR T CELL THERAPY BREYANZI FOR USE AFTER ONE PRIOR THERAPY FOR RELAPSED OR REFRACTORY LARGE B-CELL LYMPHOMA"}{'symbol': 'BMY', 'date': '2022-06-24 12:52: